+# AOS patches
+
+This file records downstream patches applied to the ARTEMIS submodule by the
+AOS mobile-testing service. Upstream updates must re-apply these patches and
+keep the `PATCH (aos-mcp)` markers.
+
+## 2026-11-04 · web LLM redaction/injection hooks
+
+- `artemis/security/redaction.py` — project-scoped secret inventory,
+  text redaction, screenshot masking by UI bounds, placeholder resolution.
+- `artemis/security/install.py` — runtime hooks for:
+  - `RobustChatModelWrapper._complete_attempt` (LLM message text redaction)
+  - `get_google_llm` direct-call wrapper
+  - `AndroidAdbDriver` / `CloudDeviceDriver` screen-data masking
+  - `AndroidAdbDriver` / `AndroidInputIME` / `CloudDeviceDriver` input injection
+  - `StorageManager` step/image writes
+  - `trace_store.update_trace_status`
+- `mcp_server/__main__.py` — calls `install()` before importing the server.
+- `tests/unit/security/test_redaction.py` — unit tests for text/image redaction.
+
+Activation: `AOS_LLM_HOOKS=1`; secret map via `AOS_LLM_SECRET_FILE` (0600 JSON).
+When hooks are disabled or cannot load, AOS fails closed for secret-bearing
+web LLM cases.
